option.CONTOUR_SHAKE_MAX_DISPLACEMENT=Contour Shaking
option.CONTOUR_SHAKE_MAX_DISPLACEMENT.comment=Controls how much contours are displaced when drawn. Set to 0 to disable.

option.CONTOUR_UB=Pencil Softness
option.CONTOUR_UB.comment=How much of the base color gets transfered when blending. Set to 0 to have no transfer, set to 1 to transfer all color.

option.CONTOUR_CS=Pencil Color
option.CONTOUR_CS.comment=Base color of the contour pencil. 0 means completely black, 1 means completely white.

option.CONTOUR_DETECTION_KERNEL_SIZE=Contour Thickness
option.CONTOUR_DETECTION_KERNEL_SIZE.comment=Thickness of contour strokes. Set to 0 to have 1 pixel thick contours.

option.CONTOUR_VIEW_DISTANCE=Contour View Distance
option.CONTOUR_VIEW_DISTANCE.comment=Clamped view distance for falloff calculations. When max distance is reached, all falloffs are maximized.

option.CONTOUR_DISPLACEMENT_FALLOFF=Shaking Falloff
option.CONTOUR_DISPLACEMENT_FALLOFF.comment=Controls the linearity of the shaking falloff. Up close the shaking value is maximized, at max distance it is disabled. Set to 0 to disable displacement falloff. Set to 1 for linear falloff, set to 3.0 for cubic falloff.

option.CONTOUR_COLOR_FALLOFF=Color Falloff
option.CONTOUR_COLOR_FALLOFF.comment=Controls the linearity of the color falloff. Up close the color is darkest, at max distance it is white/transparent. Set to 0 to disable color falloff. Set to 1 for linear falloff, set to 3.0 for cubic falloff.

option.CONTOUR_COLOR_FALLOFF_MINIMUM=Minimum darkness
option.CONTOUR_COLOR_FALLOFF_MINIMUM.comment=Minimum darkness a contour can have. Ignores color falloff. Set to 0 to allow contours to completely disappear.

option.CONTOUR_THICKNESS_FALLOFF=Thickness Falloff
option.CONTOUR_THICKNESS_FALLOFF.comment=Controls the linearity of the thickness falloff. Up close contours are thickest, at max distance contours are 1 pixel wide. Set to 0 to disable thickness falloff. Set to 1 for linear falloff, set to 3.0 for cubic falloff.

option.CONTOUR_NOISE=Contour Roughness
option.CONTOUR_NOISE.comment=Max amplitude of random noise within contour strokes. Set to 0 to completely disable noise.

option.CONTOUR_UW=White Preservation Mult
option.CONTOUR_UW.comment=Multiplier for preserving white pixels above the threshold.

option.CONTOUR_WP_THRESHOLD=Contour WP Threshold
option.CONTOUR_WP_THRESHOLD.comment=Threshold for which pixels are white enough to preserve their whiteness when blending. Set to 0 to prevent every pixel above the threshold from being colored. Set to 1 to allow every pixel to be colored.




option.CROSSHATCH_UB=Pencil Softness
option.CROSSHATCH_UB.comment=How much of the base color gets transfered when blending. Set to 0 to have no transfer, set to 1 to transfer all color.

option.CROSSHATCH_UW=White Preservation Mult
option.CROSSHATCH_UW.comment=Multiplier for preserving white pixels above the threshold.

option.CROSSHATCH_WP_THRESHOLD=Crosshatching WP Threshold
option.CROSSHATCH_WP_THRESHOLD.comment=Threshold for which pixels are white enough to preserve their whiteness when blending. Set to 0 to prevent every pixel above the threshold from being colored. Set to 1 to allow every pixel to be colored.




option.SHADOW_QUALITY=Shadow Quality
option.SHADOW_QUALITY.comment=Amount of times shadows are sampled. Higher values require more work.

option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS=Shadow Softness
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.comment=How soft shadows are. Set to 0 for complete pixelation.

option.AMBIENT_LIGHT=Ambient Light
option.AMBIENT_LIGHT.comment=Base world light level.

option.SUN_BRIGHTNESS=Sun Brightness
option.SUN_BRIGHTNESS.comment=How much the sunlight contributes to lighting calculations.

option.MINIMUM_SKY_BRIGHTNESS=Min Sky Brightness
option.MINIMUM_SKY_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Minimum brightness level of the sky.




option.ALBEDO_BLEND=Default Color Blend
option.ALBEDO_BLEND.comment=How much of the default albedo is used. Set to 0 to only use the tint and paper textures.